            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>CbarDuo 1.4.4</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>About 90% less background CPU with the popover closed</li>
                    <li>Volume and Mic tabs about 70% lighter while open, Network and System about 35%</li>
                    <li>Per-app volume checks apps only when it needs to</li>
                    <li>In-app updates now use CbarDuo's own signing key</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
