            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>CbarDuo 1.4.3</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Redesigned popover with Network, Volume, Mic, Battery, Bluetooth and System tabs</li>
                    <li>Per-app volume, mute and output routing</li>
                    <li>Battery health, energy-heavy apps, battery temperature and power draw</li>
                    <li>System stats: temperatures, CPU and GPU usage, memory, uptime, USB devices</li>
                    <li>Requires macOS 15 and an Apple Silicon Mac</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
